<report>
<title>Sample size for Pearson correlation</title>
<line></line>
<line>Alpha = <inu>alpha</inu></line>
<line>Power = <inu>power</inu></line>
<line>Correlation coefficient under null hypothesis = <inu>r0Fmt</inu></line>
<line>Correlation coefficient under alternative hypothesis = <inu>r1Fmt</inu></line>
<line>Estimated minimum sample size = <in>size</in></line>
</report>
